[00:08.24]Glorious Jehovah, almighty, eternal,
[00:13.46]Perfect in justice, in power, in love.
[00:46.95]Source of all truth and of infinite wisdom,
[00:54.89]You rule as Sov’reign in heaven above.
[01:03.77]We as your people delight in your service;
[01:12.07]Your Kingdom truth we delight to proclaim.
[01:19.75](Chorus)
[01:19.90]Being your Witnesses, great is our priv’lege.
[01:30.85]Oh, may we ever live up to our name!
[01:48.64]Working together in your sacred service
[01:55.36]Binds us as brothers in love and in peace.
[02:04.57]Teaching the truth and reflecting your glory
[02:12.22]Fill us with joy as your praises increase.
[02:21.14]Known by your name, O Jehovah, our Father,
[02:29.26]We have the honor to add to your fame.
[02:39.83](Chorus)
[02:39.98]Being your Witnesses, great is our priv’lege.
[02:50.24]Oh, may we ever live up to our name!
